{:edb/db-before-t 2437 :edb/db-after-t 2438 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535750 50 #inst "2026-10-09T06:32:56.613Z" 13194139535750 true] [17592186087698 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364776 13194139535750 true] [17592186087698 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364779 13194139535750 true] [17592186087698 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364783 13194139535750 true] [17592186087754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364765 13194139535750 true] [17592186087754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186364772 13194139535750 true] [17592186364765 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364766 13194139535750 true] [17592186364765 1089 "q-105752" 13194139535750 true] [17592186364765 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535750 true] [17592186364765 1100 "The quartic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=2,$ and ${x}_{4}=-1$ and the coefficient of the quartic term is $1.$ Find $P(x).$" 13194139535750 true] [17592186364765 1113 #uuid "40acc59f-8823-5531-95a7-abbc1303ec56" 13194139535750 true] [17592186364765 1145 "Since our quartic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=2,$ and ${x}_{4}=-1,$ and the coefficient of the quartic term is $a=1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3})(x-{x}_{4}) & =1(x-2)(x-2)(x-2)(x-(-1)) \\\\  & =1(x-2)(x-2)(x-2)(x+1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1(x-2)(x-2)(x-2)(x+1) & =1({x}^{2}-4x+4)({x}^{2}-x-2) \\\\  & =1({x}^{4}-{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-4{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}+8x+4{x}^{2}-4x-8) \\\\  & =1({x}^{4}-5{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-8) \\\\  & ={x}^{4}-5{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)={x}^{4}-5{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}+4x-8.$" 13194139535750 true] [17592186364766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364767 13194139535750 true] [17592186364766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364768 13194139535750 true] [17592186364766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364769 13194139535750 true] [17592186364766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364770 13194139535750 true] [17592186364766 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364771 13194139535750 true] [17592186364766 1040 #edb/ref 175921